    "text": "By Nick Perkins ,\n9 hours ago CASPER, Wyo. — The Natrona County Fire District released findings from an investigation into the recent Cole Creek Wildland Fire, which occurred on Tuesday, June 9. A release from the NCFD says that the fire was contained on June 9 at approximately 11:46 a.m. It burned 47.2 acres. No structures were lost and there were no reported injuries. Read full article\n1",
